{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18078","headline":"读皇甫湜公安园池诗书其後二首 二 · 韩愈","name":"读皇甫湜公安园池诗书其後二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我有一池水，蒲苇生其间。\n虫鱼沸相嚼，日夜不得闲。\n我初往观之，其後益不观。\n观之乱我意，不如不观完。\n用将济诸人，舍得业孔颜。\n百年讵几时，君子不可闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18078.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18078","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}